<title>HONG KONG: Guangdong Inv mulls leather unit spinoff.</title>
<headline>Guangdong Inv mulls leather unit spinoff.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guangdong Investment Ltd said on Friday &quot;an advance booking&quot; form has been submitted to the Hong Kong bourse for a separate listing of its leather manufacturing business.</p>
<p>&quot;However, the timing of the proposed separate listing and the financial terms on which it might carried out are yet to be determined,&quot; said the company's managing director Chen Dazhi in the statement.</p>
<p>The company said the stock exchange has yet to consider the application of the proposed separate listing and it is premature to speculate as to when and on what terms this might happen.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
